FireflyItems: {
	FFBBadge0: While the Corrupt Moth is present:
	FFBBadge1: Defense reduced by 25%, up to 12
	FFBBadge2: 18% increased damage
	FFBBadge3: 10% increased melee and whip attack speed
	FFBBadge4: Positive base melee and whip critical strike chances are reduced to zero
	MEyeBonusTextGlowSword0: Increases the size of the glowing projectiles
	MEyeBonusTextGlowSword1: 5% increased weapon damage
	MEyeBonusTextMothBlade: Butterfly projectiles accelerate toward their targets
	MEyeBonusTextMothBow: Charges faster
	MEyeBonusTextMothChry0: Moth attacks can pass through tiles
	MEyeBonusTextMothChry1: Moth attacks have a chance to release additional corrupt rain
	MEyeBonusTextMothFan: Enhances the summoned glowing butterflies
	MEyeBonusTextMothGun0: Increases phosphorescent bullet damage
	MEyeBonusTextMothGun1: Firing does not push the player backward
	MEyeBonusTextMothYoyo: Creates eight additional orbiting projectiles with a wider range
	MothEyeBonusText: Moth Eye bonus:
	MothEyeCriteriaText: Additional effects awaken here in Hardmode
	MothEyeText0: Additional effects are active in the Firefly biome during Hardmode
	MothEyeText1: 5% increased damage with Firefly weapons
	MothEyeText2: 5% reduced mana cost
	MothEyeText3: Reduces the effect of Mana Sickness
	MothEyeText4: Grants additional effects to certain Firefly weapons
